WEBVTT

00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:02.407
Account →
App & notifications.

00:00:02.407 --> 00:00:04.914
On iPhone, open
Club Batting in Safari.

00:00:04.914 --> 00:00:08.933
Safari: … → Share.

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:13.616
Add to Home Screen.
Keep Open as Web App on.

00:00:13.616 --> 00:00:17.972
Open the new app icon.
Sign in if asked.

00:00:17.972 --> 00:00:20.553
Return to Account →
App & notifications.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:26.901
Keep Club messages
and Coaching updates ticked.

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.905
Tap Enable notifications.

00:00:28.905 --> 00:00:32.807
Choose Allow when
your phone asks.

00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:37.360
Check for
Notifications on ✓.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:42.167
Until alerts are enabled,
you’ll keep getting emails.
